bind Prepare Sample: Sample ID
bind Calibrate Equipment: Equipment Status
bind X-ray Diffraction: Sample ID
bind Microstructure Analysis: Sample ID
bind Hardness Measurement: Sample ID, Hardness Value
bind Tensile Test: Sample ID, Tensile Strength
bind Thermal Analysis: Sample ID, Thermal Conductivity
bind Corrosion Resistance Evaluation: Sample ID, Corrosion Rate
bind Document Results: Sample ID
bind Review Findings: Sample ID
bind Prepare Report: Sample ID
bind Approve Material: Sample ID, Approval Status
bind Reject Material: Sample ID, Approval Status
Sample ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Equipment Status: Calibrated, Not Calibrated
Hardness Value: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Tensile Strength: float between 0.0 and 10000.0
Corrosion Rate: float between 0.0 and 100.0
Thermal Conductivity: float between 0.0 and 1000.0
Approval Status: Approved, Rejected
Init[Prepare Sample] | |
Choice[Approve Material, Reject Material] | | |
Response[X-ray Diffraction, Microstructure Analysis] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,2,h
Chain Response[Hardness Measurement, Tensile Test] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,1,h
Succession[Thermal Analysis, Corrosion Resistance Evaluation] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,1,d
Precedence[Review Findings, Document Results] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |
Precedence[Approve Material, Review Findings] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |
Precedence[Reject Material, Review Findings] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |
Precedence[X-ray Diffraction, Calibrate Equipment] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Hardness Measurement, Calibrate Equipment] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Tensile Test, Calibrate Equipment] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Thermal Analysis, Calibrate Equipment] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Corrosion Resistance Evaluation, Calibrate Equipment] |A.Equipment Status is Calibrated | |
Precedence[Prepare Report, Document Results] | |A.Sample ID == T.Sample ID |0,1,d